Subject: [PATCH 04/31] AOSCOS: Revert "libtaskmanager: Drop window shading
 code"

Upstream-Id: bd68bc1da53c208b09a307b68412b9540ed83d4b

Use the 6.8 switch-based role dispatch in the grouping proxy and Wayland
model instead of the older if/else chains required by the original source.

